# {{app_name}}

A desktop application built with [Nive](https://github.com/nive-rs/nive).

## Development

```bash
# Build
just build

# Run
just dev

# Sync icons
just icons-sync
```

App-owned icons are exposed at `crate::widgets::icon::IconName` and render
through `nive::prelude::Icon`.

